    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5319" root="جذر" body-key="j">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَذَرَ</span></b> , (A, TA,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَذُرَ</span></b> , (TK,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَذْرٌ</span>,
(A, K,) <i>He cut,</i> or <i>cut off,</i> or <i>severed,</i> (K, TA,)
a thing: (TA:) and (K) <i>he extirpated,</i> or <i>cut
off entirely,</i> (A, K,) a thing; (A;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جذّر</span></b> ;
(S;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اجذر</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِجْذَارٌ</span>. (AZ, K.)

